{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T16:57:28+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-28T16:57:28+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"H. Lundbeck A/S","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Drug Manufacturers - Specialty & Generic","country":"Denmark","city":"Valby","website":"https://www.lundbeck.com","employees":5000,"summary":"H. Lundbeck A/S engages in the research, development, manufacturing, and commercializing pharmaceuticals for the treatment of psychiatric and neurological disorders in Europe, United States, and internationally. The company offers Abilify Maintena/ Abilify Asimtufii for schizophrenia and bipolar I disorder in adults; Brintellix/Trintellix to treat depressive disorders; Rexulti/Rxulti to treat major depressive disorder and schizophrenia; Vyepti for migraine prevention; and Cipralex/Lexapro for depression. It also provides Northera for symptomatic neurogenic orthostatic hypotension; Onfi for epilepsy; Sabril for refractory complex partial seizures and infantile spasms; Ebixa for dementia, Azilect for Parkinson's disease; Xenazine for chorea; Deanxit for depression; Cipramil for depression and anxiety; and Cisordinol for psychosis. In addition, the company develops Eptinezumab for migraine prevention; Eptinezumab, which is in phase 3 clinical trial for cluster headache; Lu AG09222, which is in phase 2 clinical trial for migraine prevention; Lu AG13909 that is in phase 1 clinical trial for neurohormonal dysfunctions; Brexpiprazole for post-traumatic stress disorder; Lu AF28996, which is in phase 1 clinical trial for Parkinson's disease; MAGLi program that is in phase 1 clinical trial for neurology; Bexicaserin, which is in phase 3 clinical trial for developmental and epileptic encephalopathies; Amlenetug that is in phase 3 clinical trial for synucleinopathies; and Lu AG22515, which is in clinical phase 1 clinical trial for neurology. Lundbeck A/S has a strategic research collaboration with Contera Pharma to develop oligonucleotide-based medicines for patients living with serious neurological conditions. The company was founded in 1915 and is headquartered in Valby, Denmark.","exchange":"Copenhagen","currency":"DKK","financial_currency":"DKK","summary_fr":"H. Lundbeck A/S se consacre à la recherche, au développement, à la fabrication et à la commercialisation de produits pharmaceutiques pour le traitement des troubles psychiatriques et neurologiques en Europe, aux États-Unis et dans le monde. La société propose Abilify Maintena / Abilify Asimtufii pour la schizophrénie et le trouble bipolaire I chez les adultes; Brintellix / Trintellix pour traiter les troubles dépressifs; Rexulti / Rxulti pour traiter le trouble dépressif majeur et la schizophrénie; Vyepti pour la prévention de la migraine; et Cipralex / Lexapro pour la dépression.","summary_fr_excerpt":true},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":52385476608,"shares_outstanding":793128424,"trailing_pe":13.469387,"forward_pe":8.565589,"price_to_book":1.945038,"ev_to_ebitda":7.126,"ev_to_revenue":2.27,"dividend_yield":0.022,"payout_ratio":0.2934,"beta_yahoo":0.241},"targets":{"current_price":52.8,"mean":50.125,"median":50.0,"high":62.0,"low":36.0,"n_analysts":12,"reco_mean":2.33333,"reco_key":"buy"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-11-11"],"eps_avg":1.49899,"eps_low":1.40581,"eps_high":1.59,"revenue_avg":6369954150,"ex_dividend":"2026-03-19","dividend_date":null},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.00101,"institutions_pct":0.80662,"institutions_float_pct":0.80744004,"institutions_n":156,"institutions":[],"funds":[{"name":"VANGUARD STAR FUNDS-Vanguard Total International Stock Index Fund","pct":0.0046,"shares":3686602,"value":194652582,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":-0.0023},{"name":"DFA INVESTMENT DIMENSIONS GROUP INC-DFA Intl Small Cap Value PORT.","pct":0.0041,"shares":3282250,"value":173302797,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":0.0},{"name":"College Retirement Equities Fd.-College Retirement